msgid "输入"
msgstr "Input"

msgid "会话鼠标驱动"
msgstr "Session Mouse Driver"

msgid "鼠标输入方式，对所有任务生效"
msgstr "How mouse input is sent; applies to all tasks"

msgid ""
"在 RDP 会话里用 Interception 驱动产生真实鼠标点击（能过新手引导、不受窗口激活影响）；绑定不到设备时自动退回 "
"PostMessage。关掉则始终用 PostMessage"
msgstr ""
"Inside an RDP session, use the Interception driver to send real mouse clicks"
" (works with tutorials and is not affected by window activation); falls back"
" to PostMessage automatically when no device can be bound. When off, "
"PostMessage is always used"

msgid ""
"用 Interception 驱动产生真实鼠标点击（能过新手引导、活动层等只认真实输入的界面）；绑定不到设备时自动退回 "
"PostMessage。关掉则始终用 PostMessage"
msgstr ""
"Use the Interception driver for real mouse clicks (needed for tutorials, the"
" Free Time layer and other screens that only accept real input); falls back "
"to PostMessage when no device can be bound. When off, always use PostMessage"

msgid ""
"自动识别：远程桌面用会话鼠标，本机桌面用 PostMessage（不动你的光标）；\n"
"远程桌面：只在 RDP 会话里用该会话的 RDP 鼠标；\n"
"本机桌面：用机器上的真实鼠标点击，跑的时候会接管光标，别同时用鼠标。\n"
"设的环境和实际不符时退回 PostMessage，不往别的桌面点。改了下一次点击就生效"
msgstr ""
"Auto detect: session mouse on Remote Desktop, PostMessage on the local desktop (your cursor is not touched);\n"
"Remote Desktop: use the RDP mouse of this session, only inside an RDP session;\n"
"Local desktop: click with the machine's real mouse, which takes over the cursor while running, so do not use the mouse at the same time.\n"
"If the setting does not match the actual environment, PostMessage is used and nothing is clicked on another desktop. Changes apply from the next click"

msgid "远程桌面用哪台 Interception 鼠标（10~19），自动 = 按本会话实际收到的标记识别"
msgstr ""
"Which Interception mouse (10~19) to use on Remote Desktop; Auto = detect "
"from the marker this session actually receives"

msgid "本机桌面用哪台 Interception 鼠标（10~19），自动 = 本机桌面收到标记的第一台"
msgstr ""
"Which Interception mouse (10~19) to use on the local desktop; Auto = the "
"first one whose marker reaches the local desktop"

msgid "运行环境"
msgstr "Environment"

msgid "远程桌面鼠标设备"
msgstr "Remote Desktop mouse device"

msgid "本机桌面鼠标设备"
msgstr "Local desktop mouse device"

msgid "自动识别"
msgstr "Auto detect"

msgid "远程桌面"
msgstr "Remote Desktop"

msgid "本机桌面"
msgstr "Local desktop"

msgid "自动"
msgstr "Auto"
